cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Emergency Route Finder: Flood-Aware Referral Routing with AccessMod"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Khan"
    given-names: "Khalilur Rahman Ridoy"
    alias: "khalilurrrahmanridoykhan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/khalilurrrahmanridoykhan/emergency-route-finder"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Flood-aware emergency referral routing for Sunamganj, Bangladesh. For a start point,
  an emergency type and a season (dry or flood), reports the right facility, travel
  time, path, mode and backup facility, using WHO AccessMod for the travel-time surface.
keywords:
  - accessmod
  - health accessibility
  - emergency referral
  - flood response
  - Bangladesh
